# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Do NOT set NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL here.
#
# .env.local overrides BOTH .env.development and .env.production, so a value here
# forces the same backend URL into `npm run dev` AND `npm run build`. That is how
# a production export accidentally ships pointing at http://localhost:5000.
#
# The API URL is now chosen automatically by the command you run:
#   npm run dev    ->  .env.development  ->  http://localhost:5000/api
#   npm run build  ->  .env.production   ->  https://hrms-backend-t3lj.onrender.com/api
#
# Use this file only for machine-specific overrides you never want committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
